  designCard:
    intendedDifficulty: 12/12
    routeConcept: Two long cellar routes cross twice and end at opposite goals.
    towerRoleOpportunities:
    - 2-4 high-value crossfire pockets
    - long-range coverage
    - splash choke
    - economy-safe fallback
    dominantThreat: The heaviest mixed assault combines route, armor, and speed pressure.
    ultimateOpportunities: Route convergence and long sight lines create deliberate
      area and global ultimate windows.
    accessibilityNotes: Distinct spawn/goal anchors, high-contrast paths, readable
      no-build obstacles, and camera-safe tactical points.
